that's where it's like the writer Eric

00:30:26.110 --> 00:30:32.110
Roth in this case is going for the real
I think is taking you know the situation

00:30:32.110 --> 00:30:35.860
the people where they're at and saying
what is real to have happen next and

00:30:35.860 --> 00:30:40.840
plus he's throwing in some very damaged
